## WiCSum Thresholding（加权累积和阈值选择）

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

WiCSum（Weighted Cumulative Sum）Thresholding是V-Rex提出的动态token选择算法，用于替代fixed top-k selection。对每layer/head独立计算Query×KeyCluster^T得ScoreCluster矩阵，按每行score×token_count加权求和，从高分bucket开始累积直到超过动态阈值即停止，实现per-layer/per-head自适应token数量选择。与fixed top-k的"所有layer/head选相同数量token"不同，WiCSum在每个layer和head上独立决定选择多少token，适应不同layer/head对token importance的异质性分布（论文Fig.20显示layer间retrieval ratio从4.2%到44.0%变化，head间也有显著差异）。

从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，比如术语所在pipeline的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

WiCSum Thresholding in ReSV pipeline：

```
// Input: Query (Q_shape = [num_queries, d_head])
//        KeyCluster (shape = [num_clusters, d_head]) from Hash-bit Clustering
//        HC_table: {token_count per cluster}
// Hyperparameters: Thr_wics = 0.3 (threshold ratio), N_hp = 32

// Step 1: ScoreCluster Computation
ScoreCluster = Q @ KeyCluster^T  // [num_queries, num_clusters]
// 仅对representative KeyCluster计算，非完整key cache
// computational savings: |clusters| << |full tokens|

// Step 2: Preprocess (per row i of ScoreCluster)
for each query row i:
    Sum_i = 0
    for each cluster j:
        Sum_i += ScoreCluster[i][j] * HC_table[j].token_count  // Equation (1)
    Th_wics_i = Sum_i * Thr_wics                                // Equation (2)
    // e.g., Sum_i=100, Thr_wics=0.3 → Th_wics_i=30

// Step 3: Early-Exit Token Selection (per row i)
sorted_scores, sorted_clusters = sort_descending(ScoreCluster[i])
// 排序后: [(score_σ(0), cluster_σ(0)), (score_σ(1), cluster_σ(1)), ...]
Acc_i = 0
selected_clusters_i = []
for t = 0 to num_clusters-1:
    Acc_i += sorted_scores[t] * HC_table[σ(t)].token_count  // Equation (3)
    selected_clusters_i.append(σ(t))
    if Acc_i > Th_wics_i:
        break  // Early exit: 剩余clusters不再检查
// Paper: avg only 16% of scores per row needed to reach threshold

// Step 4: Aggregate
all_selected_clusters = unique(∪ selected_clusters_i for all rows)
// 通过HC_table映射回原始token indices
selected_tokens = [HC_table[c].token_indices for c in all_selected_clusters]
```

